editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/manuscript/chapter-47.md-239-He did not think that had been wrong. If he had gone east in the week of the case, the word would be on four files now, and a line on Withrow's charter.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/manuscript/chapter-47.md-240-
editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/manuscript/chapter-47.md-241-It had cost what it cost: thirty slips for a room Karis might not be let speak in, a thousand landings on one foot, a letter on a table that could not be opened, a bundle as thick as a man's hand, ink to the knuckle.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/manuscript/chapter-47.md-242-
editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/manuscript/chapter-47.md:243:None of them had said they were leaving. He did not think any of them had decided it, in so many words, even alone. It was only that there were now three boxes on a shelf, and two under a bed, and a carter's book in a coat, and a new strap on a satchel, and five beans in a gardener's jar.
