editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/STATE_LEDGER.md-954-**Proceedings.** No sitting in M6. No instrument served. File designations unchanged. **No third move by the faction**; Seln reads the silence as a schedule. The clean door (PROVISIONAL): *fled* enters forty days after the fourth sitting's close (day 115) if Cael is absent; the house's charter takes a line for harbouring; three associates' files take a note (four files with his); after a ruling and before a revocation's effect, withdrawal is entered *resigned in good standing*. Vastin will decline to certify the re-evaluation protocol when asked (he says so in Ostrand; M7 enters the declining).
