editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/STATE_LEDGER.md-1099-- **Eighth (day 138):** Gault's notes produced entire (seventeen panel notes, five others, one of them the seventy-sixth day); received. The petitioner disclaims knowledge of the gate order and relies on none of the volume. A further supplemental upon the recorded invocations of the integrity provisions (nineteen leaves and a table).
