editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/STATE_LEDGER.md-1101-- **The Archmarshal's answer (about day 155):** *The Archmarshal declines to certify.* Sent by the noon dispatch; not yet before the seat on the page.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/STATE_LEDGER.md-1102-- **Eleventh (day 166):** the house moves under the hearing provision's second paragraph that the advocate of record be heard at the close; no objection; **"The seat will consider the motion at the close."** Merits concluded. Two closing sittings in the year's last month, a week apart; the ruling on its last Fifth-day; hours to be notified.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-06-the-compacts-hand/STATE_LEDGER.md-1103-- File designations unchanged. **No instrument served beyond the production order. No third move by the faction.** Seln files a true, empty return every week.
